"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is an\nexample of such a group, written additively.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch00-foundations/10-groups.html"}